  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Are you experiencing problems with Hay Day and you wish to contact Supercell?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>You can access the Supercell Support window directly within the game by going to <a href=\"/wiki/settings-22791\" title=\"Settings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Settings</a> &gt; Help and Support.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a2/Help_Message.png/revision/latest?cb=20151125095341\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Help Message\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a2/Help_Message.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151125095341\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>You can click on this link to go to their Help Form: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://supercell.helpshift.com/a/hay-day/?p=web&amp;contact=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://supercell.helpshift.com/a/hay-day/?p=web&amp;contact=1</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li>You can email them about fraud issues: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://supercell.com/en/fraud-issues/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://supercell.com/en/fraud-issues/</a></li></ul>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030123\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 