  "wikitext": "\n{{PageDisplay}}\n==='''Are you experiencing problems with Hay Day and you wish to contact Supercell?''' ===\n\n* You can access the Supercell Support window directly within the game by going to [[Settings]] > Help and Support.\n[[File:Help Message.png|150px|center]]\n\n* You can click on this link to go to their Help Form: https://supercell.helpshift.com/a/hay-day/?p=web&contact=1\n\n* You can email them about fraud issues: http://supercell.com/en/fraud-issues/\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Problemas en Hay Day\n}}\n[[Category:Help]]\n[[zh:卡通农场问题]]",
